<</Title(Marcin Anforowicz - Resume)/Subject(Marcin Anforowicz is a master's student at the Paul G. Allen School of Computer Science & Engineering at the University of Washington. He has applicable software development experience from industry and academia. He's a quick learner, and a productive team player.)/Keywords(C, C++, Rust, Python, PyTorch, Javascript, Typescript, ESP32, KiCad, circuit design, GDB, CAN bus, serial protocols, Arduino, Verilog, SystemVerilog, Java, User interface, User experience, UI, UX, full-stack, web, research, machine learning, networks, distributed systems, data visualization, operating systems, security, digital design, systems programming, linguistics, software, team player, Docker, FreeRTOS)/Author(Marcin Anforowicz)/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20260714000000Z)/CreationDate(D:20260714000000Z)>>
